## m-1 (XRv9000): G3(CUST-B・アドレスあり)の VRF を CUST-T へ変える → 30 秒待って ping
configure
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01(config)#
vrf CUST-T
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01(config-vrf)#
address-family ipv4 unicast
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01(config-vrf-af)#
root
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01(config)#
interface GigabitEthernet0/0/0/3
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01(config-if)#
vrf CUST-T
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01(config-if)#
commit
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01(config-if)#
show configuration failed
% No such configuration item(s)
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01(config-if)#
end
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01#
show running-config interface GigabitEthernet0/0/0/3
interface GigabitEthernet0/0/0/3
 description CUST-B site 1 (CEB1)
 vrf CUST-T
 ipv4 address 172.16.21.1 255.255.255.0
!
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01#
show ipv4 vrf all interface brief | include "0/0/0/3"
GigabitEthernet0/0/0/3         172.16.21.1     Up              Up       CUST-T  
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01#
ping vrf CUST-T 172.16.21.2 count 3
Type escape sequence to abort.
Sending 3, 100-byte ICMP Echos to 172.16.21.2 timeout is 2 seconds:
...
Success rate is 0 percent (0/3)
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01#
ping vrf CUST-B 172.16.21.2 count 2
Type escape sequence to abort.
Sending 2, 100-byte ICMP Echos to 172.16.21.2 timeout is 2 seconds:
UU
Success rate is 0 percent (0/2)
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01#
## m-2: 外す(vrf を消す= グローバルへ)
configure
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01(config)#
interface GigabitEthernet0/0/0/3
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01(config-if)#
no vrf
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01(config-if)#
commit
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01(config-if)#
show configuration failed
% No such configuration item(s)
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01(config-if)#
end
RP/0/RP0/CPU0:XR01#
